        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSB55, 5\" x 5\" Heavy Duty Plain Bearing Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB55-specifications.gif?v=1704354687\" width=\"530\" height=\"260\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSB3 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Heavy Duty 5\" x 5\" Solid Brass Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.145\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB55-specifications.pdf?v=1704262329\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB55 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's Brass Hinge Finials</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "5 x 5 Heavy Duty Square Corner Solid Brass Hinge",
                "description": "5 inch Brass Hinge With Square Corners, Heavy Duty 0.145 inches thick. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors, available in 4 different finishes",
